			(property "Description" "Extending the reach of USB 3.2 Gen 1 (SuperSpeed) up to 16m  Cable types supported are STP (Shielded Twisted Pair) and Coax  Cable lengths supported - Up to 5m when USB 2.0 signaling included in cable - Up to 16m when USB 3.2 only  EyeOpen technology automatically performs cable compensation 0 to 24 dB with 1 dB steps  MarginLink integrated signal integrity test capability  CDR (Clock-Data Recovery) restores signal timing integrity in both directions  Reference Clock-free operation (no"
